{"title": "Ironvine Shield", "pageid": 10877, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ironvine_Shield", "categories": ["Bugs", "Shields", "Uncommon items", "Sources of Piercing damage", "Druid set", "Gish (hybrid) set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Wood_Woad_Shield_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Wood_Woad_Shield_Icon.png/300px-Wood_Woad_Shield_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2e/Wood_Woad_Shield_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Ironvine Shield image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Wood_Woad_Shield_Icon.png/300px-Wood_Woad_Shield_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Wood_Woad_Shield_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Ironvine Shield</span></a> is an uncommon <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_(equipment)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shield (equipment)\">Shield</a> that damages the attacker if the wielder is using a weapon empowered with <a href=\"/wiki/Shillelagh\" title=\"Shillelagh\">Shillelagh</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Each whorl and groove and worm-curled twist of this shield evokes a tangle of bog-stuck trees in rain-swollen vines.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n <div class=\"bg3wiki-ac-value\" style=\"grid-template-columns: 42px; 1fr\">\n<div><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/60px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/80px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"ac-value\" aria-label=\"Armour class: +2\">+2</div>\n<div class=\"ac-value-comment\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" title=\"Shields\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/25px-Shields_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/38px-Shields_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/50px-Shields_Icon.png.webp